WP2eu4A&oe=6A53A72C"}, "display_name": "MetaBlogger", "keywords": ["videoplatform", "blog", "blogger", "interactive"], "long_description": "Every day, millions of people watch online videos, but the experience is completely one-sided. You sit back, watch, and if you have a question, you can only hope for an answer buried in a sea of comments. The creators you follow dictate the pace, the topics, and the flow\u2014there\u2019s no way to engage in real-time.\n\nOn top of that, traditional content consumption is limited to flat, 2D screens. No matter how immersive the storytelling, you\u2019re still just an observer, not a participant.\n\nMetaBlogger VR revolutionizes content consumption by making it interactive, responsive, and fully immersive. Instead of passively watching a video, you step inside a VR-powered world where AI-driven metabloggers replace traditional human creators. These AI hosts are not just digital avatars\u2014they respond instantly to your questions, adapt to your interests, and engage with you in a way that no pre-recorded video ever could.", "short_description": "MetaBlogger lets you engage with AI-powered metabloggers in real time. Interrupt, ask questions, and get instant responses as you explore a new era of interactive media. \nKey Features:\n- AI-driven metabloggers instead of human creators\n - Real-time interaction\u2014ask questions anytime"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.alindor.tech/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Alindor", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.alindor.tech/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "1228796255027646"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQU